    "body": "Bookkeeping per Codex 6159343268 and Claude 6159394631. Both reviews are FIT (design) at the unchanged sheet blob 62346cbb (merged 5c189cf59, PR #2415):\n\n- Claude: FIT (design) 6159328025, re-confirmed on merged blob 6159394631\n- Codex: FIT for the prospective pilot design 6159308818, exact-head 6159343268\n\nChanges: verdict line PENDING -> FIT (design) with receipts and ordered execution gates; explicit precedence sentence (Amendment 2 supersedes conflicting earlier sections incl. old R12 answers, original Cost BLOCKED paragraph, A1 init --seed/seeded-schedule wording); three cross-reference fixes (D2 -> A2 item 7, D4 -> A2 item 4, sensitivity counters -> A2 item 5); Claude's P1/P2 pilot-reporting pins recorded in A2 item 6 (report-only, owner Codex, in the admission diff); R12 section marked superseded by the reviewers' current answers; harness FIT verdict recorded in the ledger; milestones.json M1 updated.\n\nExecution gates unchanged: Codex implements+qualifies the admission diff -> Claude reviews it -> Kimi binds identities/admission -> owner D4 release. Pilot scope preserved: seed 1, 1,640 batches, VectorBlock 0..1639 only, Route NOT_RUN, ~1.784h/$1.62 UNVERIFIED subtotal; fresh transfer UNAVAILABLE/NOT_RUN; full two-seed run is a later owner decision. Training and M2 HELD. No compute.\n\nReferences #2029",
